@flexiarg buffer-cleaner/wiring-conservative
@title Wiring: Conservative
@keywords wiring, args, threshold, eligibility, candidate-reconstruction
@audience adapter, G computation
@tone normative
@style pattern
@grade technique
@references [buffer-cleaner/observe-categories buffer-cleaner/classify-staleness buffer-cleaner/kill]
@provenance The second candidate rational reconstruction (see wiring-aggressive for the frame).

! conclusion:
  Eligibility: stream, http, file-stale only; file stale-age 24h
  (86400s).

  + ARGS: {eligible-kinds #{stream http file-stale}
    file-stale-age-seconds 86400} — machine projection in the lab's
    wirings/conservative.edn.

  + BECAUSE: narrow eligibility + long threshold = act only where the
    channel is decisive or the age-prior is low.
